# Environment.
#
# `.env.example`, `.env.development`, `.env.test` and `.env.production` ARE
# committed - they hold non-secret defaults so a fresh clone runs (and tests)
# with no setup. Personal overrides go in `.env.local` / `.env.*.local`, which
# are ignored below.
# Never put a secret in any of them: Vite inlines VITE_* into the bundle.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

